{"step_index":86,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T13:45:49Z","input_tokens":3032,"cache_read_tokens":92526,"output_tokens":1896,"thinking":"Examining the required files and product requirements, focusing on `log.txt` and `code/main.py`. The logging file requires appending an entry after each interaction. The main script necessitates clean, robust, deterministic implementation.\n\n\nThe primary script will process 518 test cases, generating a CSV output. Comprehensive documentation and an evaluation framework are planned, including an evaluation report assessing accuracy and a usage report detailing resource consumption. A trace packaging script supports submission requirements.\n\n\nThe core script, `code/main.py`, requires modular components for data modeling and audit processing.  These include modules for request classification, identity resolution across multiple data sources, evidence indexing and correlation, and policy enforcement based on deletion rules. The data models and module functionalities are key to building a robust audit agent.\n\n\nThe agent's behavior is dictated by a strict sequence of operations across different data types. Each data type undergoes distinct operations such as deletion, redaction, anonymization, disabling, or blocking restore. The `StepSequencer` dictates the phases: FINDING, REMEDIATION, and VERIFICATION.\nThe FINDING phase always proceeds in the specified order:  `REPORT_REMAINING_RECORD`, `REPORT_EXPOSED_PII`, `REPORT_ACTIVE_DATA_FLOW`, and `REPORT_RESTORE_RISK`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"& \".\\venv\\Scripts\\python.exe\" -c \"\nimport csv, json\n\nwith open('Oct_Orchestrate/dataset/sample_output.csv', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    sample_out = list(csv.DictReader(f))\n\nprint(f'Read {len(sample_out)} sample output rows successfully.')\nfor r in sample_out[:3]:\n    print(r['case_id'], r['deletion_status'], r['steps_json'][:60])\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\saaad kabir\\Desktop\\Full Project\\Oct_Orchestrate","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Verifying sample output loading","toolSummary":"Verify sample_output.csv format"}}]}
